# Copy to .env and fill in real values. Never commit .env.
# Supabase project (Vol 11_0 Section 5) — create a free project at https://supabase.com
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

# Cloud AI model provider (Vol 11_0 Section 4) — used server-side only in Phase 2;
# in Phase 1 this is read by the app's AI pipeline module directly for prototyping.
# Do not ship a real key inside the client bundle for a production build — see README.
EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_PROVIDER=anthropic
# Required for real Expense classification (Sprint 3, src/ai/providers/anthropicProvider.ts)
# AND for photo/receipt extraction (extractExpenseFromImage), which always uses this direct
# call regardless of the Gateway settings below. Without this set, classify()/
# answerFinancialQuestion() fall back to EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_GATEWAY_URL if set, then to the local
# keyword-matching placeholder (src/ai/providers/localHeuristicProvider.ts) — capped below the
# auto-record confidence threshold, so nothing posts without a human confirm.
EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key
EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5
# Optional cost-estimation overrides (USD per 1K tokens) — see anthropicProvider.ts.
EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_INPUT_COST_PER_1K=0.003
EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_OUTPUT_COST_PER_1K=0.015

# AI Gateway (Sprint 6, text-only phase — see src/ai/providers/gatewayProvider.ts).
# When set, signed-in owners' classify() and answerFinancialQuestion() calls route through the
# centralized AI Gateway (separate repo: ai-gateway-service) instead of calling Anthropic
# directly, so no provider key ships inside this app's bundle for those calls. Photo/receipt
# extraction is unaffected — it always uses EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_API_KEY above until the Gateway
# supports multimodal messages. Requires: (1) AiFA registered as an app in the Gateway's `apps`
# table, (2) a BYOK or platform credential configured in the Gateway for this app's users —
# neither is done yet as of Sprint 6. Leave unset to keep using EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_API_KEY /
# the local placeholder exactly as before.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_GATEWAY_URL=https://<gateway-project-ref>.supabase.co/functions/v1
# EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_GATEWAY_APP_ID=aifa
